    <div class="two">
      <div>
        <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Parametres</span></div>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div><label class="flabel">Journaliste</label><input class="finp" id="pj" placeholder="Oumar Maiga"></div>
          <div><label class="flabel">Media</label><input class="finp" id="pm" placeholder="Jeune Afrique"></div>
          <div><label class="flabel">Beats</label><input class="finp" id="pb2" placeholder="Business, Finance, BRVM"></div>
          <div><label class="flabel">Client / Sujet</label><input class="finp" id="pc" placeholder="BBGCI, IPO BRVM"></div>
          <div><label class="flabel">Angle editorial</label><select class="fsel" id="pa"><option value="scoop">Scoop / Exclusivite</option><option value="portrait">Portrait / Interview CEO</option><option value="analyse">Analyse de marche</option><option value="tendance">Tendance sectorielle</option><option value="impact">Impact social ou culturel</option><option value="award">Prix / Distinction</option></select></div>
          <div><label class="flabel">Langue</label><select class="fsel" id="pl"><option value="fr">Francais</option><option value="en">Anglais</option></select></div>
          <div class="s2"><label class="flabel">Contexte additionnel</label><textarea class="ftxa" id="pctx" placeholder="Chiffres cles, timing, embargo..."></textarea></div>
        </div>
        <button class="gbtn" id="genbtn" onclick="genPitch()">Generer le pitch</button>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Pitch genere</span></div>
        <div class="pout ph" id="pout">Le pitch email personnalise apparaitra ici...</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px">
          <button class="cbtn" id="copybtn" style="display:none" onclick="cpPitch()">Copier</button>
          <button class="cbtn" id="regenbtn" style="display:none" onclick="genPitch()">Regenerer</button>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:.04em" id="ptip"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- INTEL -->
<div id="panel-intel" class="panel">
  <div class="phead">
    <div><div class="pkick">Module 06 / Intel</div><div class="ptit">Alertes <em>&amp; signaux</em></div><div class="pdesc">Campagnes primees, mouvements d'agences, nouvelles regulations, calendriers awards.</div></div>
    <div class="hs"><div><div class="hsn">9</div><div class="hsl">Alertes</div><div class="hsd">3 critiques</div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pb"><div class="two">
    <div>
      <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Alertes temps reel</span></div>
      <div class="intel-row"><div><div class="itag r">Award</div><div class="itime">il y a 1 h</div></div><div><div class="ititl">Cannes Lions 2026 : shortlist PR Lion publiee</div><div class="ibody">Trois campagnes africaines presentes pour la premiere fois. Une campagne ivoirienne en lice dans la categorie Brand Experience.</div></div></div>
      <div class="intel-row"><div><div class="itag o">Regulation</div><div class="itime">il y a 3 h</div></div><div><div class="ititl">ARPP France : nouvelles directives RSE et greenwashing</div><div class="ibody">Entree en vigueur septembre 2026. Obligation de preuve pour toute allegation environnementale.</div></div></div>
      <div class="intel-row"><div><div class="itag g">Marche</div><div class="itime">il y a 5 h</div></div><div><div class="ititl">Ex-DG Publicis West Africa lance une structure independante a Lagos</div><div class="ibody">Signal fort sur la consolidation du marche pub africain independant.</div></div></div>
      <div class="intel-row"><div><div class="itag o">Award</div><div class="itime">il y a 6 h</div></div><div><div class="ititl">Effie Awards MENA : nouvelle categorie Afrique subsaharienne</div><div class="ibody">Deadline 30 juillet 2026. Frais d'inscription 350 USD par case study.</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Calendrier awards 2026</span></div>
      <table class="caltab"><tr><td>Cannes Lions PR Lion</td><td>17-21 juin</td></tr><tr><td>Clio Awards</td><td>Deadline 15 juillet</td></tr><tr><td>Effie MENA Afrique</td><td>Deadline 30 juillet</td></tr><tr><td>Africa Cristal Festival</td><td>Novembre 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Pitcher Awards 2027</td><td>Inscriptions oct. 2026</td></tr></table>
      <hr class="sep">
      <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Tendances 2026</span></div>
      <table class="caltab"><tr><td>Brand activism authentique</td><td style="color:var(--red)">Tres fort</td></tr><tr><td>Experiential digital-off</td><td style="color:var(--green)">Montant</td></tr><tr><td>Earned media first</td><td style="color:var(--green)">Montant</td></tr><tr><td>Greenwashing narratif</td><td style="color:var(--red)">Risque</td></tr><tr><td>Nano-influence PR</td><td style="color:var(--green)">Montant</td></tr></table>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<!-- VEILLE -->
<div id="panel-veille" class="panel">
