    <div><div class="pkick">Module 08 / Budget</div><div class="ptit">Budget <em>&amp; ROI</em></div><div class="pdesc">Valorisation earned media, comparaison earned vs paid, benchmarks sectoriels FCFA ou EUR.</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pb"><div class="two">
    <div>
      <div class="rl"><span class="rlt">Parametres</span></div>
      <div class="fgrid">
        <div><label class="flabel">Articles presse</label><input class="finp" type="number" id="ra" value="12" oninput="roi()"></div>
        <div><label class="flabel">Audience moyenne</label><input class="finp" type="number" id="raud" value="45000" oninput="roi()"></div>
        <div><label class="flabel">Passages radio / TV</label><input class="finp" type="number" id="rb" value="3" oninput="roi()"></div>
        <div><label class="flabel">Marche</label><select class="fsel" id="rm" onchange="roi()"><option value="ci">Cote d'Ivoire (FCFA)</option><option value="fr">France (EUR)</option><option value="pan">Pan-Africain</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <button class="gbtn" onclick="roi()">Calculer</button>
    </div>
